    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/f1837f8594d07a69d0f1a7e7594c5e3a.poster.avif?t=1727796851\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/f1837f8594d07a69d0f1a7e7594c5e3a.webm?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/f1837f8594d07a69d0f1a7e7594c5e3a.mp4?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim, Shoot, and Destroy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to destroy the enemy blocks. The goal is to clear all blocks before they make it to the bottom of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/a2ef40e7707e64996ab4329d3ed31df8.poster.avif?t=1727796851\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/a2ef40e7707e64996ab4329d3ed31df8.webm?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/a2ef40e7707e64996ab4329d3ed31df8.mp4?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hours of Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emme Saves the Galaxy features 1,000 challenging levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/3f18e37ff52de6d46f062d477432d795.poster.avif?t=1727796851\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/3f18e37ff52de6d46f062d477432d795.webm?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/3f18e37ff52de6d46f062d477432d795.mp4?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/1b3483ebbd0c778ce16161b279bb6596.poster.avif?t=1727796851\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/1b3483ebbd0c778ce16161b279bb6596.webm?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/1b3483ebbd0c778ce16161b279bb6596.mp4?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Created by</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elliott Ridgway - lead programmer, musician</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel Jackson - level designer, sound designer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrian Carter - artist</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/f1837f8594d07a69d0f1a7e7594c5e3a.poster.avif?t=1727796851\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/f1837f8594d07a69d0f1a7e7594c5e3a.webm?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/f1837f8594d07a69d0f1a7e7594c5e3a.mp4?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim, Shoot, and Destroy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to destroy the enemy blocks. The goal is to clear all blocks before they make it to the bottom of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/a2ef40e7707e64996ab4329d3ed31df8.poster.avif?t=1727796851\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/a2ef40e7707e64996ab4329d3ed31df8.webm?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/a2ef40e7707e64996ab4329d3ed31df8.mp4?t=1727796851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hours of Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emme Saves the Galaxy features 1,000 challenging levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443410/extras/3f18e37ff52de6d46f062d477432d795.poster.avif?t=1727796851\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_